From 625482984c498bc7e58249008d7549f8232fb3c1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Islam Meldebek <islam@example.invalid>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 13:22:43 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] Prevent double booking, add stay extension and rule-based
 refunds

- Lock the room row before the overlap check (create/extend) and add a
  PostgreSQL exclusion constraint so one room can't have overlapping
  active bookings even under concurrent requests; map the violation to 409
- POST /api/bookings/{id}/extend with free-night check and 30-night limit
- Refund policy: 100% (7+ days), 50% (3-6 days), 0% (<3 days); only for
  cancelled bookings, one refund per booking; quote + refund endpoints;
  manual refunds validated (fixes BUG-2, test 68 enabled)
- Frontend: Manage a Booking (look up/extend/cancel), refund calculator;
  define missing helpers in app.js and close the unclosed booking section
- Tests 69-94

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AAiCEzYzpRGaDbvUYvoXDH
